# GitHub shows this as "Cite this repository", and Zenodo takes the title,
# authors and licences of an archived release from it (.github/workflows/release.yml).
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use these materials, please cite them as below.
title: "InTRACt: Interplay of Text, Reader And Context in children's digital reading comprehension"
abstract: >-
  The Stage 1 Registered Report protocol of a study of how the language of
  machine-generated stories relates to children's reading pace in a multilingual
  storytelling app, with the theory object, design analysis, literature search and
  count script behind every number the protocol reports, and a conference poster
  on the study.
type: software
